This is a mini reststop before get through the Trung Luong highway. It serves some drinks and fast food such as Viet-bread with roasted duck or pork, dumplings (bánh bao), cakes (custard, croissant...). Good staff except the cashier. Its restrooms are not good (old, dirty...).

Its address is 31 Nguyễn Văn Linh, Tân Túc, Bình Chánh, Hồ Chí Minh City.

