Quite possibly the tastiest Banh Xeo in Saigon.  They serve Danang style Bánh Xèo.  They are about two thirds the size of the normal Saigon Bánh Xèo.

Excellent flavour and texture with the pancake itself and the fillings were delicious.  Had a taste of their seafood as well as “beef and enoki mushroom” options.  Both were yummilicious!

